#### all themes share the same blur_radius

- Verify: all themes share the same blur_radius
   - Expected: dark.blur_radius equals `GLASS_BLUR_SURFACE.to_u32()`
   - Expected: light.blur_radius equals `GLASS_BLUR_SURFACE.to_u32()`
